Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:24:13 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] qwen35: flash attention for prompt batches

llama.cpp's packed Q6_K dequantizer and flash-attention tiling for dense qwen35 prompt batches; flash attention is the only prompt-batch attention.

Upstream: not offered, fork only
Retire-when: with patch 1
Carried-commits: 334a9a3 6d985f6 dccb545
